        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I had a great experience with Simpli Electric! He installed an EV charger at my place and did an awesome job. Super friendly, professional, and clearly knows his stuff. Everything was done quickly. I’m pleased with the result. Definitely recommend him if you need any electrical work done!",
        "time": 1762464485,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "RAJAT DUTT",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115403147322399371991/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVN8gr1zxvlcDWYih-1T6YJMy_zBDU3tY6jmaXO2ODTuYgdRZdK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Very informative, helpful, and honest electrician. No hidden costs, and he explained everything really well. After the job was done, a wire came loose in the main panel—when I called him, he came back the same evening and fixed it with no extra charge. That’s real professionalism. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1767574574,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Vikas Toj Singh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117125838389725388617/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVXSNzqr18xIv_k8zXlc4hiJhH3Dwwu3YcPMU0C-zfCoUoX5NxZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I got several jobs done by Simpli Electrics. I found it the most genuine and reasonable one. The electrician is very humble and quite professional. He knows his job very well. Keep it up simpli Electrics!, Highly Recommended.",
        "time": 1762005242,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karandeep singh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109275941791342278717/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK3q7HJWbYBExxLZaJ8f_s7KLFR2mw4iYlr3654QYD8l2HR8A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I recently hired Simpli Electric for my project, and I couldn’t be happier with the results. He was professional, punctual, and highly skilled. The work was completed on time with great attention to detail and safety. Highly recommend him for any electrical work — truly reliable and knowledgeable!",
        "time": 1761329289,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "roshan xavier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110551963802788607301/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXPJ8uT5kJOGnjI___msAWZNI-X5EplrV8Wjpmw8cEqIUGIJzLW=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "So happy I found Simpli Electric!! Sevak recently installed LED lights in my home, with dimmer switch, as well as center lighting in two bedrooms. Almost all required brand new wiring and Sevak did a fantastic job! Very impressed! I appreciated his consistent communication throughout the entire process and was very happy that my work was able to be completed within days after receiving the detailed quote! Will definitely use Simpli Electric for all my future electrical work! Thanks Sevak.",
